"cloud_storage" = "Cloud Storage";
"cloud_guide" = " How to play cloud storage videos？\n\n1.Create TuyaSmartCloudManager object use device id.\n[[TuyaSmartCloudManager alloc] initWithDeviceId:];\n\n2.Request cloud storage data.\n[cloudManager loadCloudData:];\n\n3.Get the dates when the video is available through cloudManager.cloudDays, and request time line data with TuyaSmartCloudDayModel object.\n[cloudManager timeLineWithCloudDay:success:failure:];\n\n4.Play cloud videos within a specified time range.\n[cloudManager playCloudVideoWithStartTime:endTime:isEvent:onResponse:onFinished:];\n\n5.The detection event data is not required to be requested.\n[cloudManager timeEventsWithCloudDay:offset:limit:success:failure:];\n";
